## Live defects found & fixed during readback (both in-lane)

1. **FinalizeManualFn had no S3 grant** (it was a stub when Task 5's grants
   were written; Task 6 made it the heaviest S3 user) → AccessDenied at r3.
   Added to the tenants/* grant loop.
2. **REVERSE_ENUMS uppercasing bit the WRITER side** (r4): marshalMany
   returned doc_type 'PROCEDURE' → CHECK violation. Same class as the status
   normalization; fixed at the boundary + test now pins that every docType
   param is DB-cased. Lesson recorded: reverse-mapped columns must be
   normalized wherever marshalled values flow back into SQL.

